# Ansible - Install Docker

```yaml
 - name: Install Docker
   hosts: all
   become: yes
   tasks:
      - name: Install Docker
        yum:
         name: docker
         state: present
      - name: Start Docker
         service:
           name: docker
           state: started
           enabled: yes

